{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style>\r\n\t.titleBox {\r\n\t\tfont-family: 'Heebo', 'Pretendard', sans-serif; color: #333; padding: 0 8px; text-align: start; box-sizing: border-box;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.sectionTitleH2 {\r\n\t\tmargin: 20px 0 10px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 8.4rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: #222; line-height: 1.2;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.font-28 {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #222; margin: 0 0 30px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.block {\r\n\t\tmax-width: 645px; padding: 25px 0;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option {\r\n\t\tborder-top: 1px solid #666; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin-top: 10px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option h6,\r\n\t.textBox h6 {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 20px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option dl {\r\n\t\tdisplay: flex; align-items: center; margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 1.6rem;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option dt {\r\n\t\twidth: 155px; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; font-weight: 600;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option dd {\r\n\t\tmargin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-weight: 300;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.option i {\r\n\t\tfont-family: xeicon !important; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-right: 5px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.textBox {\r\n\t\tcolor: #333; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 10px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.textBox p {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 25px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t@media (max-width:1024px) {\r\n\t\t.sectionTitleH2 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 5rem;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.font-28 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 20px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.block {\r\n\t\t\tmax-width: 100%; padding: 20px 10px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t@media (max-width:600px) {\r\n\t\t.sectionTitleH2 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 3.2rem;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.font-28 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 18px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.option dt {\r\n\t\t\twidth: 100px; font-size: 1.4rem;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.option dd {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 1.4rem; padding-left: 10px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.option h6,\r\n\t\t.textBox h6 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 1.6rem;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.textBox p {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 1.4rem;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n</style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"titleBox\">\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitleH2\">1850A</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"font-28\">18GA, Brad Nailer</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"option block\">\r\n\r\n<h6>상품 사양</h6>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt><i class=\"xi-check-circle-o\"></i>게이지</dt>\r\n<dd>18GA</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt><i class=\"xi-check-circle-o\"></i>형태</dt>\r\n<dd>1자형</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt><i class=\"xi-check-circle-o\"></i>용도</dt>\r\n<dd>문,창틀 작용</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"textBox block\">\r\n\r\n<h6>상품 설명</h6>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: Heebo, Pretendard, sans-serif;font-size: 25.6px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;display: inline !important;float: none\">일자형 핀 사용 타카.<br />\r\n인테리어 작업에 주로 사용되는 타카입니다.<br />\r\nF30보다 길이가 긴 타카핀 사용이 가능하나 크기가 더 크고 무겁습니다.<br />\r\nF50타카로 불리기도 합니다.</span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h6>사용핀</h6>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: Heebo, Pretendard, sans-serif;font-size: 25.6px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;display: inline !important;float: none\">F단위 : 15mm~50mm</span>\r\n\r\n</p></div>\r\n</div></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}